<title>UK: Scot. Hydro-Electric finance head to retire.</title>
<headline>Scot. Hydro-Electric finance head to retire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British utility Scottish Hydro-Electric Plc said on Friday its finance director, John Gray, would retire later this year.</p>
</text>
